return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Kwa tovuti zinazopangishwa na Zinn Digital®. Inadhibiti kashe ya ukurasa ambayo seva yako ya Zinn® tayari inatoa — kusafisha kiotomatiki kwa akili wakati maudhui yanabadilika, kusafisha kwa mbali kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn®, kitufe cha kuwasha/kuzima cha Redis object-cache, kutengwa salama kwa WordPress/WooCommerce, na kuingia kwa msimamizi kwa mbofyo mmoja. Hiki ni kidhibiti cha kashe, si injini ya kashe. Unapangisha kwingine? Sakinisha Zinn® Cache Engine badala yake.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kusafisha akiba.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Ombi la kusafisha akiba limewasilishwa.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: kache nyingine ya vitu imewekwa, kwa hivyo kache ya vitu ya Redis haisimamiwi na programu-jalizi hii.','Full-page cache (LiteSpeed)'=>'Akiba ya ukurasa mzima (LiteSpeed)','Enable LSCache control'=>'Wezesha udhibiti wa LSCache','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages.'=>'Tuma vichwa vya udhibiti wa akiba na lebo za LiteSpeed kwenye kurasa zinazoweza kuwekwa akibani.','Public cache lifetime (seconds)'=>'Muda wa kuishi wa akiba ya umma (sekunde)','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Akiba ya vitu (Redis)','Enable Redis object cache'=>'Wezesha akiba ya vitu ya Redis','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in (requires the phpredis extension).'=>'Sakinisha kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu ya Redis (kinahitaji kiendelezi cha phpredis).','Redis host'=>'Mwenyeji wa Redis','Redis port'=>'Mlango wa Redis','Redis database'=>'Hifadhidata ya Redis','Redis key prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha ufunguo wa Redis','Automatic purging'=>'Usafishaji otomatiki','Smart auto-purge'=>'Usafishaji-otomatiki wa akili','Purge affected pages automatically when content changes.'=>'Safisha kurasa zilizoathiriwa kiotomatiki maudhui yanapobadilika.','Purge on updates'=>'Safisha wakati wa masasisho','Purge everything after core, plugin, or theme updates.'=>'Safisha kila kitu baada ya masasisho ya kiini, programu-jalizi, au mandhari.','Cache exclusions'=>'Uwatoaji wa akiba','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied (cart, checkout, my-account, logged-in and session pages are never cached). Add extra rules below, one per line.'=>'Chaguo-msingi zinazofaa za WordPress na WooCommerce hutumika kila mara (kurasa za kikapu, malipo, akaunti yangu, zilizoingiliwa na za kipindi haziwekwi akibani kamwe). Ongeza kanuni za ziada hapa chini, moja kwa kila mstari.','Exclude URL paths (prefix match)'=>'Toa njia za URL (ulinganishaji wa kiambishi awali)','Exclude query keys'=>'Toa funguo za hoja','Exclude cookie name prefixes'=>'Toa viambishi awali vya majina ya vidakuzi','Maintenance'=>'Matengenezo','Purge everything now'=>'Safisha kila kitu sasa','detected'=>'kimegunduliwa','not detected'=>'hakijagunduliwa','phpredis extension missing'=>'kiendelezi cha phpredis hakipo','active'=>'amilifu','inactive'=>'haifanyi kazi','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Akiba ya LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Akiba ya vitu ya Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Kiendelezi cha PHP cha Redis (phpredis) hakipatikani kwenye seva hii, kwa hivyo akiba ya vitu haiwezi kuwezeshwa.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Kipengele kingine cha kushusha cha kache ya vitu kimesakinishwa tayari. Kiondoe kabla ya kuwezesha kache ya vitu ya Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Haikuweza kuandika faili ya usanidi wa muunganisho wa Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu kilichoambatanishwa hakikuweza kusomwa.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Haikuweza kusakinisha kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu ndani ya wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Haikuweza kuondoa kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Mfumo wa faili wa WordPress hauwezi kuandikwa, kwa hivyo kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu hakikuweza kusimamiwa.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Kiungo hiki cha kuingia kwa mbofyo mmoja hakifai tena. Viungo huisha muda wake baada ya dakika kadhaa na vinaweza kutumika mara moja tu — fungua tovuti yako kutoka kwenye dashibodi ya Zinn® tena ili kupata kipya.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa lilishindwa ukaguzi wake wa uadilifu na halikusakinishwa.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Utoaji wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa ajili ya riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.']];